sequenceDiagram
    participant C as Agent / x402 client
    participant R as Seller's resource server
    participant F as Turnpike facilitator
    participant S as Stellar (Soroban RPC + SAC)

    C->>R: 1. GET /paid-resource
    R-->>C: 2. 402 Payment Required + accepts[]
    Note over C: 3. Select terms, sign a Soroban<br/>authorization entry
    C->>R: 4. Retry with PAYMENT-SIGNATURE header
    R->>F: 5. POST /verify
    F-->>R: 6. { isValid, reason? }
    Note over R: 7. Do the actual work
    R->>F: 8. POST /settle
    F->>S: 9. Submit transaction, sponsor fee
    S-->>F: 10. Settled — tx hash
    F-->>R: 11. { success, transaction }
    R-->>C: 12. 200 OK + resource + PAYMENT-RESPONSE
    Note over F: 13. Catalog the resource — DESIGNED,<br/>NOT BUILT (async, off the hot path)
